## Step 4 — Add StripeProvider to Root Layout

**What**: Wrap the entire app with `<StripeProvider>` so any screen can use Stripe.

**File**: [`app/_layout.tsx`](file:///c:/Users/ben/Downloads/GymFood-Project/app/_layout.tsx) — **MODIFY**

**Before**:
```tsx
<ClerkProvider publishableKey={publishableKey} tokenCache={tokenCache}>
  <HydrateOnAuth />
  <StatusBar style="auto" />
  <Stack ...>
    ...
  </Stack>
</ClerkProvider>
```

**After**:
```tsx
import { StripeProvider } from "@stripe/stripe-react-native";

<ClerkProvider publishableKey={publishableKey} tokenCache={tokenCache}>
  <StripeProvider publishableKey={process.env.EXPO_PUBLIC_STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY!}>
    <HydrateOnAuth />
    <StatusBar style="auto" />
    <Stack ...>
      ...
    </Stack>
  </StripeProvider>
</ClerkProvider>
```

**Also add to `.env`**:
```
EXPO_PUBLIC_STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=pk_test_XXXX
```

