## Step 5 — Create the `useStripeCheckout` Hook

**What**: A reusable hook that handles the entire Stripe payment flow in 3 function calls.

**File**: [`src/modules/checkout/hooks/useStripeCheckout.ts`](file:///c:/Users/ben/Downloads/GymFood-Project/src/modules/checkout/hooks/useStripeCheckout.ts) — **NEW**

**What it does**:

```
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  useStripeCheckout()                                     │
│                                                          │
│  Returns:                                                │
│    • initiatePayment(amount, description) → result       │
│    • loading: boolean                                    │
│    • error: string | null                                │
│                                                          │
│  Inside initiatePayment():                               │
│    1. Get Clerk token                                    │
│    2. POST to stripe-checkout Edge Function               │
│    3. Receive clientSecret                               │
│    4. Call initPaymentSheet({ clientSecret })             │
│    5. Call presentPaymentSheet()                         │
│    6. Return { success: true } or { success: false }     │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

**Why a hook**: Both the meal order screen and the consultation screen need to take payments. This hook makes the logic reusable — each screen just calls `initiatePayment(amount, description)`.

